  "b1-speaking-15": ["Even though we sometimes argue, my family is very close.", "The person I'm most similar to is my mother, we share the same personality.", "I've always got on well with my brother, despite our differences.", "When I was younger, I used to spend every summer with my cousins.", "My grandmother, who is eighty years old, still cooks for the whole family.", "I think family traditions are important because they bring people together.", "The best advice my father has ever given me is to be patient.", "Although my sister lives far away, we talk on the phone every day.", "I've been trying to spend more time with my family lately.", "If I could change one thing, I'd live closer to my grandparents."],
