  "b1-speaking-19": ["The best thing about my friend is that she always knows how to make me laugh.", "Even though we don't see each other often, we're still very close.", "I've known my best friend since we were children, and we've never had a serious argument.", "The friend who I trust most is someone I met at university.", "I think the key to a good friendship is being honest with each other.", "Although we have different personalities, we get on really well.", "The most memorable day with my friends was when we went to a concert.", "I've been trying to spend more quality time with my friends lately.", "If I had to choose one word to describe my best friend, it would be loyal.", "The reason we've stayed friends for so long is that we respect each other."],
