  "b1-speaking-34": ["Yes, I visited the Louvre when I was in Paris.", "I noticed that people in Japan are very polite and respectful.", "Yes, I love trying new dishes, especially Asian food.", "Yes, I took part in a carnival in Brazil, it was amazing.", "The most interesting tradition was the tea ceremony in Japan.", "Yes, I'd like to live in England for a few years.", "Yes, when I first arrived, everything felt very different.", "I think the best way is to talk to local people.", "Yes, I have a friend from Italy who I met on holiday.", "I'd like to adopt the habit of having a long lunch with family."],
