  "b1-speaking-187": ["One of the most interesting aspects of apologising and resolving conflicts is the way it can affect people's everyday lives.", "Although learning about apologising and resolving conflicts can sometimes be challenging, I think the benefits are worth the effort.", "If I had more time, I would become more involved in apologising and resolving conflicts and learn from other people.", "The experience that taught me most was one that made me think differently about apologising and resolving conflicts.", "What I find particularly valuable about apologising and resolving conflicts is that it can help people understand different points of view.", "Compared with the past, people now have more opportunities to learn about apologising and resolving conflicts.", "I would rather take part in a practical activity because it allows me to gain useful experience.", "The main reason I am interested in apologising and resolving conflicts is that it can have a positive effect on the community.", "People who take an active interest in apologising and resolving conflicts often become more confident and independent.", "In the future, I hope to use what I have learned to make a positive contribution."],
